# BarBerBe — Cursor rules

## Styling & UI

When editing layout, CSS, Tailwind, or visual design of React/Next.js components, **follow** `.cursor/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` (bold premium futuristic UI: hierarchy, depth, neon accents, biometric/HUD patterns where appropriate).

## Code

- Match existing project patterns; minimal unrelated refactors.
- Prefer focused diffs tied to the user request.
